  "ingredients": [
    "4 tablespoon sour cream",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "3 ounce poblano pepper",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "12 ounce cauliflower",
    "4 tablespoon butter",
    "4 large egg",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hash-with-poblano-peppers-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53617-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Cauliflower-Hash-with-Poblano-Peppers-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mix together sour cream and garlic powder. Set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hash-with-poblano-peppers-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53617-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Cauliflower-Hash-with-Poblano-Peppers-2.png"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a food processor, rice the cauliflower with the stem attached.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hash-with-poblano-peppers-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53617-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Cauliflower-Hash-with-Poblano-Peppers-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush some olive oil on the poblano pepper, then fry over medium-high heat for a couple of minutes. Set aside",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hash-with-poblano-peppers-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53617-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Cauliflower-Hash-with-Poblano-Peppers-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cauliflower and butter to the pan, then fry for 5-6 minutes or until semi-soft.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hash-with-poblano-peppers-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53617-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Cauliflower-Hash-with-Poblano-Peppers-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop up the poblano pepper and add it to the cauliflower. Remove from the pan and keep warm.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hash-with-poblano-peppers-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53617-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Cauliflower-Hash-with-Poblano-Peppers-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining olive oil to the pan, then fry eggs sunny side up or to your own preference.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hash-with-poblano-peppers-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53617-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/Cauliflower-Hash-with-Poblano-Peppers-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the eggs with cauliflower hash and sour cream dip. Season with additional salt and pepper if desired. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/cauliflower-hash-with-poblano-peppers-eggs/#wprm-recipe-53617-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
